# ── Environment / Secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*

# Exception: the public build's config. Every value in it is public by
# construction — a read-only flag, the creator's Ethereum address (which every
# query anchors on via createdBy(), so it must be known to read the index at
# all), and an empty RPC URL. Committed so the deployed build is reproducible
# from the repo; without it a Vercel build has VITE_READ_ONLY unset and lands
# in Notarize mode pointing at localhost.
# Secrets stay excluded: .env, .env.local and the rest are still ignored.
!src/Ancorhash.Web/.env.production
!.env.example

